  "notes": "1989-1991 AVUS (anticlockwise on the A115 carriageways): start/finish southbound on the western carriageway by the AVUS-Tribuene, south turn across the central reservation, northbound on the eastern carriageway, flat Nordkurve loop. The 1991 south-turn position is undocumented: it is placed at 52.4849 N so the lap measures the official 4.880 km (bridged). A 1991 chicane is mentioned in race reports but its position is unknown, so none is modelled."
